        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Rectangular fragment of a quilt, with chintzes on both faces. Chintz A: copperplate engraving in red on tabby-woven cotton. Shows hunters, hounds, carriages, involved in a shooting party. Chintz B shows a tea ground polychrome woodblock pillar print with floral sprays in interspaces. Cut on all sides; bound on one short side with brown tape. Slightly soiled."@en ;
